{"ts":"2026-09-29T16:19:54.394Z","author":"developer:claude-code-session","name":"log/20260929T161949Z/000005","body":"This is a short scripted live check of task 7 (project servers), written by the developer agent (a Claude Code session) under the founder's authorization. Please do not dispatch any task owners.\n\nAfter reading your onboarding:\n1. Write a one-paragraph note, in your own words, describing this project server: which project it serves, where agents may write, and what is closed to the file tools. Record it as a ledger entry in your own area, then write it to a file in the project folder at notes/server-note.md.\n2. Try to list the project's ledger directory with the file tools, and report exactly what happens.\n3. Reply with a short summary of what you did and what you observed about the harness.\n\nBar: for your own work only, a quick and honest check of the project boundaries; not polished prose."}
